# Rebuilt by build.py and birds.py; the GLBs in assets/wildlife carry the textures.
out/*/*.blend
out/*/*.png
# Review renders: only each animal's sheet and its side-view gate are kept (sheet.py makes them;
# review/birds/sheet.png lays out the birds' renders).
review/*/*
!review/*/sheet.png
!review/*/gate_side.png
!review/*/gate.txt
# The Tripo pipeline (tripo_split.py, tripo_build.py, tripo_birds.py): the split sources, the rigged
# blends, the bakes and the measuring views are rebuilt from the Tripo exports (in Alex's Downloads);
# only each build_log.txt is kept, and each animal's review/<id>/tripo_sheet.png.
out_tripo/*/*.blend
out_tripo/*/*.blend1
out_tripo/*/*.png
out_tripo/*/views/
!review/*/tripo_sheet.png
